This lab's capability authenticates through AWS IAM Identity Center, so
hack/pre-provision-resources.sh stages manifests/.workshop/terraform/preprovision-base
(which creates the instance, user and group) before this directory, and orders this
directory after it.

The presence of this file is the whole signal; its contents are only documentation.
Remove it and this directory is staged with no Identity Center behind it, so the
capability fails to find the group it maps to the ADMIN role.
